= Cryptocurrency wallet — Simple =

A cryptocurrency wallet manages the keys used to control blockchain accounts or assets. The assets remain represented on the ledger; the wallet gives the user a way to authorize transactions involving them.

'''Important boundary:''' wallet ≠ storage location of coins on the ledger.

